#: ../../entities/ic-design.rst:1
msgid "Shanghai IC Design Industrial Park"
msgstr "上海集成电路设计产业园"

#: ../../entities/ic-design.rst:4
msgid "上海集成电路设计产业园"
msgstr "上海集成电路设计产业园"

#: ../../entities/ic-design.rst:6
msgid "Technology park | Pudong | Research checked 2026-11-04"
msgstr "科技园区｜浦东新区｜研究核对日期 2026-11-04"

#: ../../entities/ic-design.rst:8
msgid "AI and industry focus: Chips, Hardware AI."
msgstr "人工智能与产业方向：芯片、硬件人工智能。"

#: ../../entities/ic-design.rst:10
msgid ""
"A Zhangjiang chip design ecosystem connecting design and industrial "
"services. A strong starting point for AI chip teams, with specific EDA, "
"IP, tape-out, packaging and testing access negotiated with providers."
msgstr "张江芯片设计产业生态，连接设计及产业服务。适合人工智能芯片团队；EDA、IP、流片、封装及测试须与供应商逐项确认。"

#: ../../entities/ic-design.rst:12
msgid ""
"`Evidence S029 "
"<https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/nw15343/20250210/708f661c2b46458996844fab153a0a41.html>`_. "
"浦东新区区委书记李政走访张江科学城企业."
msgstr "`证据 S029 <https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/nw15343/20250210/708f661c2b46458996844fab153a0a41.html>`_. 浦东新区区委书记李政走访张江科学城企业."

#: ../../entities/ic-design.rst:14
msgid "Status and support"
msgstr "状态与支持"

#: ../../entities/ic-design.rst:17
msgid "Published entity; intake to confirm"
msgstr "机构有来源，招募待确认"

#: ../../entities/ic-design.rst:19
msgid ""
"No standard cash award, fee waiver or equity percentage is verified for "
"this entry. Request the current written offer."
msgstr "本条未核实统一现金资助、免费权益或股权比例，请索取现行书面方案。"

#: ../../entities/ic-design.rst:21
msgid "Contact and location"
msgstr "联系与位置"

#: ../../entities/ic-design.rst:24
msgid ""
"`Official evidence and authority route "
"<https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/nw15343/20250210/708f661c2b46458996844fab153a0a41.html>`_"
msgstr "`官方来源与主管部门入口 <https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/nw15343/20250210/708f661c2b46458996844fab153a0a41.html>`_"

#: ../../entities/ic-design.rst:26
msgid ""
"Use the official website to request the responsible team and current "
"application route. Email addresses are not reproduced in this publication."
msgstr "请通过官网联系负责团队，确认现行申请渠道。本刊不刊载邮箱地址。"

#: ../../entities/ic-design.rst:28
msgid ""
"Map position uses a district or campus anchor; it is not a verified "
"office location."
msgstr "地图位置使用区级或校区锚点，并非核实后的办公室位置。"

#: ../../entities/ic-design.rst:30
msgid "Application workflow"
msgstr "申请流程"

#: ../../entities/ic-design.rst:33
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "编辑申请清单，实际流程以现行官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../entities/ic-design.rst:35
msgid ""
"Describe the prototype, required equipment, process and testing needs."
msgstr "说明样机、所需设备、工艺与测试需求。"

#: ../../entities/ic-design.rst:37
msgid "Ask for a technical review, facility visit and itemized quotation."
msgstr "申请技术审核、设施参观及逐项报价。"

#: ../../entities/ic-design.rst:39
msgid ""
"Agree access, safety, sample and IP ownership, test scope and acceptance."
msgstr "约定准入、安全、样本与知识产权、测试范围及验收。"

#: ../../entities/ic-design.rst:41
msgid ""
"Separate the facility contract from investment or public-funding "
"applications."
msgstr "设施合同与投资或财政资助分别申请。"

#: ../../entities/ic-design.rst:43
msgid ":doc:`Pudong district route </districts/pudong>`"
msgstr ":doc:`浦东新区对接路径 </districts/pudong>`"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "A direct program phone or email is not verified here. Use the official "
#~ "route and request the responsible team; no contact has been invented."
#~ msgstr "本版未核实项目直线电话或邮箱。请通过官方渠道索取负责团队，本图谱不编造联系人。"
